WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.000 --> 01:44.218
=Episode 4=

01:54.216 --> 01:56.216
Hello, I was here yesterday.

01:56.335 --> 01:57.335
I have an appointment.

01:59.496 --> 02:00.136
Security.

02:20.175 --> 02:21.655
(Aren't I the female lead?)

02:22.215 --> 02:23.416
(Where's my plot armor?)

02:23.976 --> 02:24.816
(Eaten by a dog?)

02:35.256 --> 02:36.055
Hello, Miss.

02:37.416 --> 02:38.096
No, no.

02:38.376 --> 02:39.615
Can you speak Chinese?

02:40.256 --> 02:41.455
No, no.

02:41.455 --> 02:42.256
Hello?

02:42.816 --> 02:43.775
No, no.

02:43.935 --> 02:44.615
Mr. Gao,

02:45.016 --> 02:47.096
I've tried several languages
with this lady,

02:47.096 --> 02:48.296
but she didn't understand any.

02:53.136 --> 02:54.016
Hello.

02:55.455 --> 02:57.615
Miss Lin, please stop causing a scene.

02:58.175 --> 02:59.775
You can try other companies.

03:00.055 --> 03:01.735
But not at Letao, okay?

03:03.696 --> 03:06.576
I really was sent by Yunsheng this time
to discuss cooperation.

03:07.495 --> 03:08.215
Not interested.

03:10.416 --> 03:12.215
I brought you the proposal.

03:13.455 --> 03:15.735
I was scared my first time
working at heights, too.

03:16.256 --> 03:17.376
You'll get used to it.

03:18.775 --> 03:20.495
Yes, secure the safety rope later.

03:20.856 --> 03:22.296
(Where there's a will,)

03:22.816 --> 03:23.976
(there's a way.)

03:24.655 --> 03:25.615
We still think

03:26.455 --> 03:28.416
Mr. Gao's approach is more prudent.

03:29.495 --> 03:30.895
Expanding into second

03:31.296 --> 03:33.296
and third-tier cities
and large northern areas

03:33.735 --> 03:37.935
is more reliable and cost-effective
than developing new products or brands.

03:38.536 --> 03:39.055
Yes.

03:39.376 --> 03:40.055
Haiming.

03:40.615 --> 03:43.416
We're nearing fifty,
halfway to the grave.

03:43.935 --> 03:46.655
Our thinking can't keep up
with you youngsters.

03:46.895 --> 03:50.536
But Letao is the foundation
your father built.

03:51.256 --> 03:53.376
It's not that we care about our shares.

03:53.775 --> 03:54.655
- Right?
- Yes.

03:55.655 --> 03:57.576
We've watched you grow up.

03:57.735 --> 03:59.735
We don't want to see Letao
ruined in your hands.

03:59.735 --> 04:00.935
- Exactly!
- That's right.

04:01.215 --> 04:02.775
It's for the company's best interests.

04:02.775 --> 04:03.615
Yes.

04:04.416 --> 04:05.136
Mr. Gao.

04:06.016 --> 04:07.136
Why don't you say something?

04:07.495 --> 04:09.055
Present a solid plan.

04:09.615 --> 04:11.256
Exactly, say something.

04:11.775 --> 04:13.735
We can't just let Letao...

04:18.415 --> 04:19.215
What's going on?

04:19.496 --> 04:20.176
What's she doing?

04:23.112 --> 04:25.832
(Letao Public Relations Proposal)

04:31.936 --> 04:32.576
Are you crazy?

04:34.295 --> 04:35.295
I want to show you this.

04:50.408 --> 04:54.408
♪Old photos, yellowed♪

04:54.408 --> 04:58.312
♪Timelines, tangled♪

04:59.936 --> 05:00.855
Luo, call security.

05:01.176 --> 05:01.535
Don't!

05:01.535 --> 05:01.975
Yes!

05:01.975 --> 05:02.975
- Security!
- Security!

05:03.056 --> 05:03.496
Get inside.

05:03.496 --> 05:04.376
- I'll go.
- Get in.

05:04.376 --> 05:05.136
It's dangerous.

05:05.136 --> 05:06.455
I can go back the way I came.

05:06.455 --> 05:07.095
Get in now.

05:07.095 --> 05:08.295
Don't call security!

05:14.936 --> 05:16.895
Miss Lin, this is Letao,

05:17.215 --> 05:18.095
not Hollywood.

05:18.576 --> 05:19.616
You're not Jackie Chan.

05:20.455 --> 05:22.855
I never imagined
such a big company like Letao

05:22.855 --> 05:26.176
would guard so fiercely
against a junior employee like me.

05:27.215 --> 05:28.415
You can't set foot in here.

05:28.736 --> 05:29.655
Don't waste your time.

05:31.415 --> 05:33.975
Read this first
before deciding if it's a waste of time.

05:34.736 --> 05:36.496
Before judging something,

05:36.775 --> 05:38.095
at least try to understand it.

05:39.176 --> 05:42.455
I hope Mr. Gao
won't let our personal relationship

05:42.736 --> 05:43.855
affect this proposal.

05:46.256 --> 05:47.056
Relationship?

05:47.936 --> 05:49.496
What personal relationship do we have?

05:50.335 --> 05:51.455
We've eaten together,

05:51.696 --> 05:52.655
ridden in the same car,

05:52.775 --> 05:53.895
had physical contact,

05:54.136 --> 05:55.696
and even had a financial transaction.

05:56.335 --> 05:57.295
Doesn't that count?

06:08.535 --> 06:10.176
Fine, I'll read the proposal.

06:11.095 --> 06:12.415
Business is about capability.

06:13.376 --> 06:14.975
Don't rely on flashy tricks.

06:15.056 --> 06:15.655
It's useless.

06:17.176 --> 06:17.975
You'll see

06:17.975 --> 06:19.295
if it's flashy or not.

06:20.415 --> 06:21.056
Wait.

06:25.455 --> 06:25.975
Your fine.

06:26.176 --> 06:28.136
Pay it at the Security Dept.
within three days.

06:36.535 --> 06:37.455
Working with her now?

06:39.335 --> 06:40.496
I'll read the proposal first.

06:42.496 --> 06:43.655
What about this Lin Huan'er?

06:54.415 --> 06:55.176
Just leave already.

06:56.415 --> 06:56.895
I'm going.

07:18.472 --> 07:20.080
(PR Strategy)

07:34.775 --> 07:35.616
(Can't reach you.)

07:35.895 --> 07:37.535
(What are you up to? Call back ASAP.)

07:38.056 --> 07:38.975
(Not your turn yet.)

07:38.975 --> 07:39.816
(No time for you.)

07:41.095 --> 07:43.176
Congratulations on completing Quest One,

07:43.176 --> 07:44.936
professionally linking up
with Gao Haiming.

07:45.095 --> 07:46.895
Now issuing Quest Two,

07:46.895 --> 07:48.415
gaining Gao Haiming's affection.

07:51.855 --> 07:53.376
Gaining Gao Haiming's affection?

07:54.455 --> 07:55.936
How much fondness do I need?

07:56.576 --> 07:59.496
Male Lead's Current Fondness:
Negative 5%.

07:59.496 --> 08:00.496
Good luck!

08:01.056 --> 08:01.855
Negative 5%?

08:02.455 --> 08:04.136
After all my efforts, it went down?

08:04.616 --> 08:06.295
How do I make him like me?

08:09.056 --> 08:10.335
Good luck!

08:10.455 --> 08:10.975
Hello?

08:11.295 --> 08:12.455
Good luck!

08:16.095 --> 08:17.335
You useless system!

08:21.064 --> 08:22.088
(Letao Tower)

08:26.655 --> 08:28.176
Mr. Gao, Mr. Li is back.

08:31.415 --> 08:32.096
Haiming.

08:32.376 --> 08:32.976
Uncle Li.

08:33.976 --> 08:34.815
You're finally back.

08:35.976 --> 08:36.856
You know,

08:36.856 --> 08:38.535
I've been on back-to-back
business trips.

08:38.736 --> 08:39.736
I just landed

08:40.136 --> 08:40.935
and came right here.

08:41.415 --> 08:42.016
Thank you.

08:42.016 --> 08:42.856
Have a seat, please.

08:42.856 --> 08:43.456
Alright.

08:44.575 --> 08:45.175
Here you go.

08:49.055 --> 08:50.216
It's all right.

08:50.535 --> 08:51.256
This time,

08:52.575 --> 08:57.136
we finally secured a cooperation intent
with a foreign company.

08:57.616 --> 09:01.655
But your dad thinks
their terms are too harsh.

09:02.175 --> 09:05.535
Don't you think
we should broaden our horizons?

09:07.295 --> 09:07.815
Uncle.

09:08.376 --> 09:11.136
Letao doesn't necessarily
need to represent foreign brands.

09:11.775 --> 09:13.775
Sometimes crises bring opportunities.

09:13.775 --> 09:14.415
What do you say?

09:15.616 --> 09:16.415
I know,

09:16.775 --> 09:18.856
you've always wanted
to develop new products.

09:19.456 --> 09:23.055
Truth is, Letao needs
young visionaries like you.

09:27.216 --> 09:27.856
I understand.

09:28.895 --> 09:29.695
The board

09:29.856 --> 09:31.136
are a bunch of stubborn ones.

09:35.016 --> 09:36.895
You've got drive.

09:38.216 --> 09:39.256
You're at your prime.

09:39.655 --> 09:40.736
Times are changing.

09:41.136 --> 09:42.216
Thrive in hardship,

09:42.415 --> 09:43.376
and perish in comfort.

09:44.655 --> 09:45.256
Don't worry.

09:45.695 --> 09:49.055
I'll try to convince
those stubborn old-timers.

09:49.856 --> 09:51.935
Thanks. With your word, I'm relieved.

09:52.736 --> 09:53.216
Alright.

09:53.376 --> 09:54.736
I just came to check in with you.

09:54.736 --> 09:55.415
I won't keep you.

09:55.815 --> 09:56.256
See ya.

09:56.256 --> 09:57.096
Take care, Uncle.

09:57.096 --> 09:57.456
Alright.

10:03.655 --> 10:04.175
Cheers!

10:05.336 --> 10:05.856
Cheers!

10:12.775 --> 10:13.655
(Can't find you.)

10:13.736 --> 10:15.695
(What's keeping you? Call back ASAP.)

10:15.815 --> 10:16.616
Something urgent?

10:16.616 --> 10:17.695
It's okay. Ignore him.

10:23.216 --> 10:23.976
Xiaojue?

10:25.456 --> 10:27.175
Hello? Huan'er's here.

10:31.976 --> 10:32.456
Thanks.

10:34.016 --> 10:34.496
Hello?

10:34.895 --> 10:35.456
Huan'er.

10:36.376 --> 10:37.376
You finally answered!

10:37.856 --> 10:39.336
I was worried about you.

10:39.336 --> 10:39.895
What is it?

10:40.456 --> 10:41.575
Are you mad at me?

10:41.775 --> 10:42.376
No.

10:42.655 --> 10:44.456
Then why haven't you called me back?

10:44.895 --> 10:46.616
Busy. I've been so busy.

10:47.256 --> 10:48.616
I'm tired. Going to sleep. Bye.

10:48.775 --> 10:49.376
Wait!

10:50.096 --> 10:50.655
Huan'er.

10:51.695 --> 10:52.655
I miss you so much.

10:53.775 --> 10:54.815
(Miss me?)

10:55.175 --> 10:57.096
(You miss my money, little gold-digger.)

10:57.456 --> 10:58.616
I miss you so much.

10:59.736 --> 11:03.616
It's been 783 days, 5 hours,
and 4 minutes since we last met.

11:04.136 --> 11:05.616
Sometimes I deeply regret

11:06.496 --> 11:07.815
going abroad for studies.

11:08.256 --> 11:10.295
I shouldn't have left you alone
back there.

11:10.575 --> 11:12.216
Then come back! Quit school.

11:15.655 --> 11:17.376
Huan'er, you love to joke.

11:19.136 --> 11:22.336
Mengmeng said
you were working multiple jobs,

11:22.935 --> 11:25.016
yet you wouldn't even buy new clothes.

11:27.136 --> 11:29.935
But I still shamelessly
ask you for tuition.

11:29.935 --> 11:32.376
I'm... I'm such a fool, Huan'er.

11:33.055 --> 11:35.016
I planned to get a job.

11:35.336 --> 11:37.575
I really want to ease your burden.

11:38.016 --> 11:40.175
But with graduation approaching,

11:40.175 --> 11:41.256
I'm buried in my thesis.

11:41.256 --> 11:42.935
No bandwidth for anything else.

11:44.535 --> 11:45.935
(There is your aim.)

11:46.096 --> 11:47.136
Help me one more time.

11:47.575 --> 11:49.655
I'll pay you back, alright?

11:49.856 --> 11:50.496
Sure.

11:50.496 --> 11:53.216
Write me IOU notes
for all the money I sent you before.

12:01.575 --> 12:02.935
Just kidding.

12:05.336 --> 12:06.535
Huan'er, you're such a tease.

12:07.496 --> 12:08.575
Not just the principal,

12:08.575 --> 12:09.575
some interest at least.

12:09.575 --> 12:11.695
An annual interest at 4%
is reasonable, right?

12:19.376 --> 12:20.895
You're still mad at me, aren't you?

12:21.775 --> 12:23.175
If... if you're not feeling well,

12:23.175 --> 12:24.496
we can talk another day.

12:24.616 --> 12:25.376
Don't reschedule.

12:25.376 --> 12:26.055
Let's finish it.

12:26.055 --> 12:26.935
Calls are expensive.

12:28.336 --> 12:29.655
Wait, Huan'er,

12:30.016 --> 12:31.655
why are you acting like this today?

12:32.055 --> 12:35.336
I... Talking like this
makes us feel distant.

12:36.256 --> 12:37.575
Did I do something wrong?

12:38.096 --> 12:39.575
You're mad at me, aren't you?

12:39.695 --> 12:41.935
Don't you know exactly
what you did wrong?

12:43.376 --> 12:44.256
No, I don't.

12:44.376 --> 12:46.256
If you don't know, think harder.

12:49.815 --> 12:51.256
(When did he cheat again?)

12:52.456 --> 12:53.616
Huan'er, what do you mean?

12:54.016 --> 12:55.456
I'm studying so hard over here

12:55.456 --> 12:56.935
all for our future, right?

12:57.415 --> 12:58.655
You're being a little immature.

12:58.976 --> 13:00.295
Can't you try to understand me?

13:00.415 --> 13:01.616
I can't put up with this.

13:01.856 --> 13:02.456
Let's break up.

13:02.695 --> 13:04.016
Fine, let's break up. Quickly.

13:05.415 --> 13:06.256
Unbelievable.

13:16.575 --> 13:17.295
Huan'er.

13:18.136 --> 13:19.295
You've gone too far.

13:19.575 --> 13:21.016
You should apologize to Xiaojue.

13:21.496 --> 13:22.935
Why should I apologize to him?

13:22.935 --> 13:23.775
He's a cheater.

13:23.775 --> 13:25.175
He's the one at fault here.

13:30.456 --> 13:33.496
Warning: Attempting to change
character's established trajectory.

13:33.496 --> 13:34.415
- Wait, stop!
- Warning.

13:34.415 --> 13:35.496
Player activated penalty.

13:35.496 --> 13:36.496
Don't you rewind now.

13:36.815 --> 13:37.616
I'll do better.

13:38.376 --> 13:39.856
Really, I'm sorry.

13:40.336 --> 13:42.216
I have realized my terrible mistake.

13:42.616 --> 13:43.336
Give me a chance.

13:44.256 --> 13:46.496
I'll call him right now
and win him back, okay?

13:46.935 --> 13:47.695
It's settled then.

13:51.256 --> 13:51.496
You...

13:51.496 --> 13:52.175
I was wrong.

13:52.935 --> 13:54.575
My attitude was awful just now.

13:54.575 --> 13:56.456
I'll call him immediately
to make it right.

14:11.376 --> 14:12.736
Hello?

14:15.815 --> 14:18.216
International calls are expensive.
Need something?

14:18.655 --> 14:19.856
Yes.

14:20.895 --> 14:22.136
I was wrong.

14:22.535 --> 14:24.736
My attitude earlier was terrible.

14:24.736 --> 14:26.575
How could I be so awful?

14:26.775 --> 14:29.216
I must've been working too much lately.

14:29.216 --> 14:30.616
I haven't been in a good mood.

14:32.575 --> 14:35.216
And my stomach hurts so badly right now.

14:36.775 --> 14:37.496
What's wrong?

14:37.815 --> 14:40.775
I was too busy working overtime
to have dinner.

14:40.775 --> 14:41.575
It's fine.

14:41.575 --> 14:42.336
Don't worry.

14:42.336 --> 14:44.376
I'll just drink hot water
to feel better.

14:45.815 --> 14:47.376
How could you skip dinner?

14:47.616 --> 14:48.415
That's not right.

14:48.856 --> 14:50.775
I'm working extra hours to save money.

14:50.976 --> 14:54.055
How else can I pay for your tuition?

14:54.376 --> 14:55.695
You're so good to me.

14:56.136 --> 14:57.136
Hearing that

14:57.935 --> 14:59.256
breaks my heart.

15:00.935 --> 15:01.976
It's okay.

15:02.616 --> 15:03.775
I brought this on myself.

15:03.775 --> 15:06.775
No, I mean it's all my fault.

15:07.136 --> 15:08.336
I'll work hard

15:08.336 --> 15:11.016
and make money to support you.

15:11.815 --> 15:12.415
Don't worry.

15:12.895 --> 15:14.695
I won't let you down, Huan'er.

15:15.535 --> 15:16.295
Okay, okay.

15:16.695 --> 15:18.935
Take care of yourself in France, okay?

15:19.736 --> 15:20.496
I'm in the UK.

15:21.295 --> 15:23.655
Right, take care of yourself
in the UK, okay?

15:24.336 --> 15:25.096
A little confused.

15:26.575 --> 15:28.935
It's fine. How could I ever blame you?

15:29.655 --> 15:31.856
I just want to fly back
to your side right now.

15:32.575 --> 15:34.096
Just wait two more months, okay?

15:35.016 --> 15:37.016
Okay, I'll wait for you.

15:37.376 --> 15:38.295
Take care of yourself.

15:40.016 --> 15:41.175
I'll miss you always.

15:49.976 --> 15:50.575
What's wrong?

15:51.136 --> 15:51.736
Static shock.

15:53.775 --> 15:54.575
That's more like it.

15:55.496 --> 15:56.336
Don't fight.

15:56.815 --> 15:57.935
Long-distance is tough.

16:01.655 --> 16:02.456
Mengmeng?

16:03.935 --> 16:04.616
Thanks.

16:08.935 --> 16:10.216
Bugs in the diapers?

16:10.695 --> 16:11.376
Keep it down.

16:11.376 --> 16:12.376
With such a huge scandal,

16:12.376 --> 16:13.976
who would dare to buy this brand?

16:15.336 --> 16:17.136
Beikeke probably won't make it.

16:18.336 --> 16:20.456
But it might be a calculated move.
Think about it.

16:20.815 --> 16:22.016
Right after making the news,

16:22.136 --> 16:23.775
they immediately held a press conference

16:23.775 --> 16:25.336
and experts debunked the rumors.

16:26.216 --> 16:27.935
Isn't this cleverly disguised promotion?

16:28.736 --> 16:29.456
Exactly.

16:29.856 --> 16:31.575
Such a brilliant tactic,
truly masterful.

16:32.295 --> 16:33.535
How did they come up with it?

16:33.768 --> 16:34.656
(Newsstand)

16:37.576 --> 16:38.376
(Baby Stores Clear Shelves)

16:38.696 --> 16:39.432
(Beikeke Deep in Worm Scandal)

16:39.432 --> 16:40.104
(Infant Product Trust Crisis)

16:40.104 --> 16:41.000
(Beikeke Deep in Worm Scandal)

16:44.136 --> 16:45.736
Well played, Gao Haiming.

16:46.096 --> 16:47.295
You directly used

16:47.575 --> 16:48.895
my proposal, didn't you?

16:49.616 --> 16:51.016
Do you even understand copyright?

16:51.456 --> 16:52.496
You didn't even tell me

16:52.496 --> 16:53.456
before using it.

16:57.527 --> 16:59.308
(Baby Stores Pull Beikeke Products)

17:11.496 --> 17:12.095
Mr. Gao,

17:12.896 --> 17:13.855
the Chairman has acted.

17:14.335 --> 17:14.855
He used it

17:14.855 --> 17:17.375
to announce the Xie family
marriage alliance on the magazine.

17:17.496 --> 17:18.535
What do we do now?

17:20.615 --> 17:23.375
Yunsheng's crisis PR plan for Beikeke

17:23.375 --> 17:24.976
aligns perfectly with our concept.

17:25.656 --> 17:27.176
We should discuss this further.

17:27.696 --> 17:30.256
Mr. Gao,
I'm talking about you and Miss Xie.

17:32.904 --> 17:34.376
(Elite Marriage, Power Joining Forces
for Golden Match)

17:36.496 --> 17:37.615
There's Lin Huan'er, right?

17:54.656 --> 17:55.375
Thank you.

17:56.416 --> 17:57.016
Thank you.

18:01.696 --> 18:03.656
I just love seeing them together.

18:05.055 --> 18:06.976
Look, aren't they well-matched?

18:06.976 --> 18:07.936
Well-matched? How?

18:07.936 --> 18:09.095
How could they not be?

18:10.815 --> 18:12.736
Elite marriage, power joining forces.

18:12.855 --> 18:13.855
A perfect match.

18:15.896 --> 18:20.135
When will you ever
tell the truth in your life?

18:20.496 --> 18:21.976
When have I not told the truth?

18:22.416 --> 18:22.896
Chairman.

18:22.896 --> 18:23.535
Wait a moment.

18:24.936 --> 18:26.135
How old is our son?

18:26.736 --> 18:27.696
He's an adult.

18:27.696 --> 18:28.896
He's a man.

18:29.456 --> 18:32.775
At his age, what matters most?

18:32.775 --> 18:33.575
What?

18:33.575 --> 18:35.055
Career matters most.

18:37.896 --> 18:38.496
What is it?

18:39.016 --> 18:40.496
Chairman, as you instructed,

18:40.896 --> 18:41.855
after the statement,

18:41.855 --> 18:42.855
the Xie family

18:42.976 --> 18:43.736
tacitly approved.

18:44.335 --> 18:46.855
But Mr. Gao hasn't responded.

18:47.896 --> 18:50.055
Haiming is holding his composure well.

18:50.736 --> 18:51.896
But it's okay.

18:51.896 --> 18:53.456
Once public opinion spreads,

18:54.256 --> 18:55.615
he'll have to accept it.

19:02.936 --> 19:03.416
Go.

19:09.896 --> 19:13.160
(Yunsheng Tower)

19:14.575 --> 19:15.135
Mr. Gao.

19:16.535 --> 19:17.016
Mr. Fang.

19:17.016 --> 19:17.696
Welcome! Welcome!

19:18.416 --> 19:19.016
Please come in.

19:27.896 --> 19:29.216
I'll summon her immediately.

19:31.375 --> 19:33.055
Lin! Lin!

19:34.496 --> 19:35.375
Come here, now!

19:36.496 --> 19:37.696
You there, come here.

19:42.496 --> 19:44.535
Lin, sit down. Have a seat.

19:46.815 --> 19:49.335
So, Lin,

19:49.575 --> 19:50.416
thanks to you,

19:50.736 --> 19:54.416
Mr. Gao awarded our firm
the entire Letao PR project.

19:57.855 --> 20:01.575
(You stole my plan to salvage
your brand crisis without telling me.)

20:01.936 --> 20:03.575
(Now you came for cooperation.)

20:04.016 --> 20:06.135
(Who knows if this is another trap)

20:06.295 --> 20:07.976
(or fishing for my next proposal?)

20:08.416 --> 20:10.416
Shocked now, aren't you?

20:10.855 --> 20:12.335
I knew she couldn't handle pressure.

20:12.936 --> 20:15.216
Miss Lin seems hesitant
about our collaboration.

20:15.456 --> 20:16.815
Feel free to state your terms,

20:16.976 --> 20:17.896
and we can negotiate.

20:18.256 --> 20:20.416
No, we have no demands.

20:20.736 --> 20:22.095
Mr. Gao's time is valuable.

20:22.095 --> 20:23.855
Let's finalize early to speed things up.

20:23.855 --> 20:25.535
Paperwork takes considerable time.

20:27.335 --> 20:28.496
Alright, I'll take my leave.

20:28.696 --> 20:29.456
Sure, Mr. Gao.

20:29.456 --> 20:29.855
Goodbye.

20:29.855 --> 20:30.335
Goodbye.

20:31.216 --> 20:32.055
Twenty percent.

20:35.936 --> 20:39.256
I want an extra twenty percent
service fee.

20:41.335 --> 20:42.095
Wait, Mr. Gao...

20:42.416 --> 20:42.936
No problem.

20:45.016 --> 20:45.976
On one condition.

20:46.496 --> 20:47.456
For subsequent tasks,

20:47.736 --> 20:49.855
you must personally
work on it, Miss Lin.

20:58.615 --> 20:59.416
Come with me.

21:00.615 --> 21:01.736
Well, I won't keep you.

21:02.456 --> 21:02.936
Goodbye.

21:03.095 --> 21:03.775
Goodbye, goodbye.

21:05.936 --> 21:07.855
Oh my.

21:09.256 --> 21:10.496
Twenty percent?

21:26.135 --> 21:27.535
You even agreed to twenty percent.

21:28.216 --> 21:29.656
What is this game, Mr. Gao?

21:33.016 --> 21:33.736
I'll head down.

21:38.335 --> 21:38.976
Miss Lin,

21:39.736 --> 21:41.535
the whole process is interconnected.

21:42.016 --> 21:43.216
Without your proposal to me,

21:43.496 --> 21:45.135
there wouldn't be my generous offer

21:45.135 --> 21:45.936
as you wished.

21:48.216 --> 21:50.176
Of course,
if you feel it's inappropriate,

21:50.535 --> 21:51.696
we don't have to do it.

21:52.936 --> 21:53.815
Is this a threat?

21:54.535 --> 21:55.456
Hardly.

21:56.815 --> 21:58.295
I told you, I'm a businessperson.

21:58.656 --> 21:59.936
I don't do worthless talks.

22:00.696 --> 22:03.375
I just didn't expect you
to change so much.

22:05.135 --> 22:05.976
Before yesterday,

22:05.976 --> 22:07.016
I didn't expect

22:07.456 --> 22:10.896
you to be someone who uses
others' proposals without permission.

22:13.095 --> 22:15.456
It seems you have
quite a misunderstanding about me.

22:19.416 --> 22:22.656
I agreed to that 20%
out of sincerity to work with you.

22:23.775 --> 22:24.335
I admit

22:24.696 --> 22:26.375
I had misunderstandings
about you before.

22:26.775 --> 22:28.416
But now that we're working together,

22:28.936 --> 22:30.976
we'll need to coordinate
frequently on work matters.

22:33.456 --> 22:34.016
Miss Lin.

22:34.535 --> 22:36.696
How about we formally
reintroduce ourselves?

22:51.936 --> 22:52.575
Miss Lin.

22:53.575 --> 22:54.496
I look forward to it.

23:07.016 --> 23:07.896
Congratulations.

23:08.095 --> 23:10.135
Male Lead's fondness
toward you is now 0.

23:10.256 --> 23:11.575
Keep up the good work!

23:12.456 --> 23:13.335
Thanks.

23:14.135 --> 23:15.416
What great news.

23:16.416 --> 23:17.775
I'm starting from scratch now.

23:19.736 --> 23:20.736
Huan'er, I'm heading out.

23:21.016 --> 23:21.575
Bye.

23:22.216 --> 23:23.256
Uh, Lin,

23:23.256 --> 23:25.496
could you take the Letao contract
to Mr. Gao for me?

23:25.936 --> 23:26.535
Now?

23:27.335 --> 23:28.936
Letao are probably off work by now.

23:29.696 --> 23:31.855
Don't overthink unexpected windfalls.

23:31.855 --> 23:32.775
Delays breed troubles.

23:32.936 --> 23:35.456
So I had Finance and Legal
rush out a contract.

23:35.456 --> 23:36.176
Go now.

23:36.575 --> 23:38.135
Take a taxi. On the company.

23:38.976 --> 23:41.496
Does this count as overtime for me?

23:41.936 --> 23:42.575
Lin,

23:42.736 --> 23:43.976
if this deal goes through,

23:43.976 --> 23:45.375
your commission will be this much.

23:48.135 --> 23:49.216
Alright, I'll go, I'll go!

23:49.416 --> 23:49.976
There you go.

23:53.216 --> 23:53.976
Lin Huan'er.

23:55.656 --> 23:56.615
(Smells like trouble.)

23:57.976 --> 23:59.176
I want to see your boss.

24:06.295 --> 24:06.855
Hello.

24:17.896 --> 24:19.295
What's going on?

24:19.335 --> 24:21.496
She probably wants you to fire me.

24:22.535 --> 24:23.016
Yes.

24:26.335 --> 24:29.456
So, uh, how may I address you?

24:41.216 --> 24:42.535
Fuchuang.

24:43.896 --> 24:45.575
Xie Wanjun.

24:46.936 --> 24:49.736
You... You're the heiress
of Fuchuang Group,

24:49.736 --> 24:50.575
Miss Xie?

24:51.375 --> 24:53.055
So... what brings you here today?

24:55.496 --> 24:58.135
(Brand Promotion Contract)
This is our branding and PR contract.

24:58.696 --> 25:00.656
The contract term is ten years.

25:01.095 --> 25:03.496
I wonder if your company is interested.

25:05.176 --> 25:06.256
Yes, we're interested!

25:06.575 --> 25:08.095
W-We are absolutely interested!

25:09.055 --> 25:09.575
Uh,

25:09.575 --> 25:10.496
Miss Xie,

25:10.496 --> 25:11.696
let me confirm with you.

25:12.055 --> 25:14.855
You mean the entire
Fuchuang International Group's

25:14.855 --> 25:19.256
complete branding
and PR strategic contract, right?

25:20.055 --> 25:20.535
Yes.

25:22.736 --> 25:23.855
Fire her,

25:27.416 --> 25:28.615
and the contract takes effect.

25:32.176 --> 25:32.775
Well,

25:32.775 --> 25:34.496
Miss Xie, the thing is,

25:35.055 --> 25:37.216
Miss Lin has just joined us,

25:37.295 --> 25:39.656
and she has little presence
in the company.

25:39.656 --> 25:41.416
If you don't like her,

25:41.496 --> 25:43.335
I can transfer her
to another department.

25:43.335 --> 25:45.375
You'll never see her again.

25:46.736 --> 25:51.135
Only the cowardly and weak
would resort to such methods.

25:55.295 --> 25:56.335
Lin Huan'er! You...

25:56.815 --> 25:57.736
What do you mean?

25:58.055 --> 25:59.575
You're scared,

25:59.855 --> 26:01.456
so you choose to run away.

26:02.135 --> 26:03.295
Who do you think you are?

26:03.295 --> 26:04.335
I'm nobody.

26:04.335 --> 26:05.936
I'm just an ordinary employee,

26:05.936 --> 26:08.575
who just secured a contract at Yunsheng,

26:08.575 --> 26:10.736
which happens to be
the one Letao gave me.

26:10.736 --> 26:11.575
That's all.

26:12.095 --> 26:15.016
Believe it or not, I can go to Letao
and one word from me

26:15.135 --> 26:16.815
will exclude you from this deal.

26:17.575 --> 26:18.896
I don't believe you.

26:19.496 --> 26:21.016
Where do you get that confidence?

26:21.736 --> 26:24.416
Do you think Haiming
will always protect you?

26:26.976 --> 26:27.456
You!

26:27.736 --> 26:29.575
Fire her now! Immediately!

26:29.936 --> 26:31.256
And I'll sign the contract.

26:31.696 --> 26:33.896
Otherwise, you'll lose both deals.

26:33.896 --> 26:35.656
Um, well, Miss Xie,

26:35.736 --> 26:38.016
I... I really can't make this decision.

26:38.335 --> 26:40.775
Mr. Gao specifically requested
Miss Lin to handle it.

26:43.456 --> 26:44.575
Miss Xie.

26:45.055 --> 26:47.615
You're thinking way too simply.

26:47.976 --> 26:49.216
Even if I left Yunsheng,

26:49.416 --> 26:51.335
I'd still be in Gao Haiming's life.

26:52.496 --> 26:55.016
Aren't you just using work
as an excuse to cling to him?

26:55.496 --> 26:56.535
Let me tell you.

26:57.016 --> 27:00.575
Haiming only sees this
as an amusing game.

27:00.736 --> 27:03.496
He's not truly into you.

27:04.095 --> 27:05.256
Well, if you know everything,

27:05.256 --> 27:06.416
why are you so worried?

27:07.736 --> 27:09.176
If I were you

27:09.335 --> 27:10.575
and I hated someone,

27:10.615 --> 27:12.815
I wouldn't let them off so easily.

27:12.976 --> 27:15.016
I'd keep that person close to me,

27:15.016 --> 27:16.295
become their client,

27:16.295 --> 27:17.855
control them every day,

27:17.855 --> 27:18.696
and squeeze them dry.

27:19.575 --> 27:23.095
But it seems you lack that courage.

27:24.016 --> 27:25.055
Who says I don't dare?

27:25.575 --> 27:26.535
Well, it doesn't matter.

27:26.696 --> 27:27.855
I just thought about it.

27:28.456 --> 27:30.496
I might actually be better off
without Yunsheng.

27:30.936 --> 27:32.416
Think about it. I'm now at Yunsheng,

27:32.736 --> 27:34.936
and Haiming immediately
threw a huge deal my way.

27:35.095 --> 27:36.456
If I were unemployed,

27:36.575 --> 27:38.855
he might just hire me directly at Letao.

27:39.375 --> 27:40.176
That's perfect.

27:40.176 --> 27:41.976
That way, I can be with Haiming all day.

27:42.256 --> 27:43.656
Boss, fire me right now!

27:43.656 --> 27:44.936
I'm going to work at Letao!

27:45.335 --> 27:47.256
Goodbye! I'm off to see Haiming!

27:47.256 --> 27:47.936
Lin!

27:48.055 --> 27:48.855
Get back here!

27:52.416 --> 27:55.055
Lin Huan'er, I've changed my mind.

27:57.055 --> 27:58.216
When I hate someone,

27:58.896 --> 28:02.896
I will slowly torment them
using every means at my disposal.

28:06.736 --> 28:08.135
I'll sign this contract with you,

28:08.575 --> 28:09.456
but on one condition.

28:09.775 --> 28:10.295
What is it?

28:10.696 --> 28:13.696
Lin Huan'er must be
the point of contact for execution.

28:17.095 --> 28:19.696
Boss, you can't agree to this!

28:19.855 --> 28:21.216
She'll torture me!

28:21.335 --> 28:22.335
Do you agree or not?

28:24.335 --> 28:25.976
Agree to it!

28:28.696 --> 28:29.575
Alright then.

28:42.016 --> 28:43.496
Goodbye, Miss Xie.

28:46.896 --> 28:49.176
Be careful on your way, Miss Xie.

28:52.335 --> 28:53.855
Listen, Lin,

28:54.135 --> 28:55.656
I'm lucky to have you on board.

28:55.976 --> 28:59.016
Two massive contracts
in just one short day!

28:59.496 --> 29:00.575
You're my lucky charm.

29:01.855 --> 29:02.896
It's no big deal.

29:03.055 --> 29:03.775
Rest assured,

29:03.936 --> 29:05.416
I won't treat you unfairly.

29:05.736 --> 29:07.216
Once the first payment comes in,

29:07.216 --> 29:08.696
I'll give you a bonus immediately.

29:11.456 --> 29:12.095
So,

29:13.216 --> 29:15.055
about you and Mr. Gao...

29:17.016 --> 29:17.656
Nonsense!

29:17.936 --> 29:19.615
Use your brain!

29:19.615 --> 29:21.016
If I had anything to do with him,

29:21.016 --> 29:22.615
why would I be working here?

29:23.095 --> 29:23.615
True.

29:23.615 --> 29:24.095
Right?

29:24.615 --> 29:29.135
Miss Xie is a woman in love,
grasping at shadows.

29:29.696 --> 29:31.976
But you can't jump
to conclusions so easily.

29:32.176 --> 29:33.095
You're right.

29:33.095 --> 29:33.896
How shallow!

29:33.896 --> 29:35.055
Yes, I am shallow.

29:35.375 --> 29:36.216
Do I have it easy?

29:36.335 --> 29:36.815
No.

29:36.815 --> 29:37.976
Every day here,

29:37.976 --> 29:39.135
I work so hard at this desk.

29:39.135 --> 29:41.815
And now, at this hour,
I have to deliver a contract to Letao!

29:41.815 --> 29:44.216
Who told you to d-deliver it
to Letao at this hour?

29:44.575 --> 29:45.855
How could you do that?

29:46.095 --> 29:48.496
You should take a taxi home
and rest right now,

29:49.456 --> 29:50.095
on the company.

29:52.295 --> 29:55.176
Uh, j-just deliver it tomorrow morning.

30:02.615 --> 30:03.496
Fang.

30:03.976 --> 30:05.335
You don't have it easy either.

30:05.456 --> 30:06.256
It's alright.

30:06.335 --> 30:07.135
You've worked hard.

30:07.135 --> 30:09.335
Not at all, not at all.

30:10.496 --> 30:11.815
Be careful on your way, Miss Lin.

30:14.792 --> 30:16.808
(Letao Tower)

30:22.615 --> 30:24.216
Mr. Gao's meeting is ending soon.

30:24.216 --> 30:25.055
Just wait right here.

30:26.135 --> 30:26.815
Don't run off.

30:27.216 --> 30:28.095
This isn't Hollywood.

30:48.375 --> 30:50.055
(I remember the book saying)

30:50.256 --> 30:52.335
(he only accepts
commissions for assembly.)

30:52.936 --> 30:54.135
(Did they change the setting?)

30:54.496 --> 30:55.575
(He collects them, too?)

30:56.416 --> 30:59.055
(They're limited editions
that appreciate.)

31:04.736 --> 31:06.456
For effectively resolving the issue,

31:06.615 --> 31:08.575
you get a random gift package
from the system

31:08.855 --> 31:10.016
to speed things up for you.

31:10.135 --> 31:11.496
Would you like to claim it?

31:11.775 --> 31:12.496
Gift package?

31:13.176 --> 31:13.855
Claim.

31:14.855 --> 31:15.615
Please confirm.

31:15.615 --> 31:16.295
Confirm.

31:23.336 --> 31:24.911
(Glue)

31:25.736 --> 31:26.775
What's this?

31:34.016 --> 31:34.815
Are you crazy?

31:52.256 --> 31:52.855
I'm sorry.

31:56.295 --> 31:57.496
Let me take off my jacket.

31:57.496 --> 31:58.855
Hold still. It's okay.

31:59.095 --> 31:59.615
I'll do it.

32:00.219 --> 32:03.176
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

32:06.312 --> 32:09.832
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

32:11.752 --> 32:16.808
♪I've become the center of the story♪

32:17.704 --> 32:22.074
♪I must escape this dream♪

32:23.656 --> 32:28.256
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

32:30.736 --> 32:31.775
Wait, wait!

32:35.575 --> 32:36.496
Perhaps we... we can

32:36.496 --> 32:38.416
find scissors and cut the clothes?

32:41.135 --> 32:41.696
Okay.

32:51.016 --> 32:52.936
Oh my! Why are they hugging?

32:56.680 --> 33:00.648
♪Old photos, yellowed♪

33:00.648 --> 33:04.520
♪Timelines, tangled♪

33:06.456 --> 33:07.176
Got any scissors?

33:09.160 --> 33:12.104
♪Heart pounding, won't stop♪

33:13.815 --> 33:14.335
You do it.

33:15.456 --> 33:16.016
Alright.

33:16.488 --> 33:20.486
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

33:21.032 --> 33:24.680
♪Your smile is like stars that shimmer♪

33:25.096 --> 33:30.468
♪Lighting up my lonely corner♪

33:31.720 --> 33:39.336
♪Love's time machine,
flies, flies, flies♪

33:42.375 --> 33:43.216
It's a heart shape...

33:46.256 --> 33:47.696
I'm so sorry. Really sorry.

33:48.176 --> 33:48.855
Miss Lin.

33:49.936 --> 33:52.295
You always make a memorable entrance.

33:55.112 --> 33:59.688
♪Streaking across the sky♪

34:00.712 --> 34:07.976
♪Just to hold you♪

34:07.976 --> 34:09.016
What are you all doing?

34:09.496 --> 34:10.336
Get back to work.

34:16.655 --> 34:17.336
Miss Lin.

34:18.095 --> 34:19.936
It's a shame
you didn't become an actress.

34:20.615 --> 34:22.655
You came up with a new stunt
in just minutes.

34:24.135 --> 34:25.016
It's not that.

34:26.615 --> 34:27.976
I know you won't believe me,

34:29.175 --> 34:32.095
but the glue suddenly floated

34:32.416 --> 34:35.175
and squirted onto my clothes like this.

34:35.655 --> 34:37.296
Then Mr. Gao bumped into me.

34:38.215 --> 34:38.735
I believe it.

34:40.456 --> 34:41.135
Keep going.

34:45.735 --> 34:47.055
(I barely made it here.)

34:47.416 --> 34:48.575
(How did I mess up again?)

34:49.016 --> 34:51.016
(Is this darn system tricking me?)

35:08.095 --> 35:08.936
(Stop, stop.)

35:09.095 --> 35:10.416
(You're here on business.)

35:24.655 --> 35:25.336
Miss Lin.

35:26.816 --> 35:27.615
Chairman Gao.

35:28.695 --> 35:29.296
Let's talk.

35:34.473 --> 35:37.456
♪Entwined worries linger♪

35:38.665 --> 35:41.436
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

35:43.337 --> 35:49.250
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

35:51.047 --> 35:54.107
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

35:55.273 --> 35:58.725
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

35:59.721 --> 36:05.247
♪Until the world's end♪

36:07.657 --> 36:11.453
♪If I could♪

36:12.041 --> 36:14.857
♪Keep loving you♪

36:15.881 --> 36:18.281
♪Hearing two hearts♪

36:18.281 --> 36:23.197
♪Beating together♪

36:24.169 --> 36:28.033
♪If I could♪

36:28.033 --> 36:31.273
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

36:32.329 --> 36:39.654
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

36:40.713 --> 36:43.657
♪Entwined worries linger♪

36:44.905 --> 36:47.657
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

36:49.513 --> 36:55.293
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

36:57.225 --> 37:00.250
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

37:01.495 --> 37:05.161
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

37:05.929 --> 37:11.776
♪Until the world's end♪

37:13.769 --> 37:17.673
♪If I could♪

37:18.281 --> 37:21.033
♪Keep loving you♪

37:22.089 --> 37:24.425
♪Hearing two hearts♪

37:24.425 --> 37:29.385
♪Beating together♪

37:30.377 --> 37:33.940
♪If I could♪

37:33.940 --> 37:37.641
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

37:38.633 --> 37:45.865
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪
